{"pages":[{"w":612.0,"h":792.0,"s":[[13.889,2.206,18.17,3.8,3.431,"EQUINOX"],[13.889,5.306,14.953,1.205,1.078,"Q U A N T I T A T I V E"],[69.444,2.807,15.359,1.643,1.471,"India Equity Research"],[69.444,4.27,11.266,1.46,1.307,"16 November 2026"],[13.889,10.995,29.544,3.651,3.268,"Divi’s Laboratories"],[13.889,14.731,27.131,2.373,2.124,"Growth is real, so is the price"],[13.889,20.845,52.931,1.809,1.634,"Divi’s Laboratories (DIVISLAB) has risen 11% since Saturday’s Q2 FY27"],[13.889,22.289,52.931,1.809,1.634,"results and 74% over 12m, near a record. Revenue from operations grew 35% to"],[13.889,23.733,52.931,1.809,1.634,"₹3,676 cr, EBITDA rose 76% to ₹1,566 cr (42.6%) and PAT rose 64% to ₹1,127"],[13.889,25.177,52.951,1.809,1.634,"cr. H1 revenue was ₹6,756 cr (+31.8% y/y) with EBITDA of ₹2,828 cr (41.9%)."],[13.889,26.621,52.931,1.809,1.634,"Constant-currency sales grew 17%; custom synthesis was 62% of H1 revenue"],[13.889,28.065,29.024,1.809,1.634,"and materials fell to 32% of sales from 40%."],[13.889,30.551,52.964,1.809,1.634,"1) We model H2 FY27 revenue up 22% (guidance: double-digit) and EPS of"],[13.889,31.995,52.931,1.809,1.634,"₹65.91, taking FY27E EPS to ₹142.34, 6% below consensus, which needs H2"],[13.889,33.439,52.931,1.809,1.634,"profit up 40% y/y. 2) FY28E/FY29E EPS are ₹170.02/₹198.71 as the three"],[13.889,34.883,52.936,1.809,1.634,"dedicated capex programs reach commercial supply; FY27-29E capex is about"],[13.889,36.328,52.931,1.809,1.634,"₹2,000 cr a year (H1: ₹872 cr; CWIP ₹1,638 cr). 3) Nutraceuticals grew to ₹571"],[13.889,37.772,50.96,1.809,1.634,"cr from ₹492 cr in H1; working capital is the swing factor (H1 CFO: ₹384 cr)."],[13.889,40.258,52.959,1.809,1.634,"Our Dec-27 target of ₹6,690 averages two methods. Own three-year average P/E"],[13.889,41.702,52.961,1.809,1.634,"of 53.5x on earnings twelve months after Dec-27 gives ₹10,247. A ten-year DCF"],[13.889,43.146,52.936,1.809,1.634,"of FY28-37 cash flows at 12%, plus Dec-27 net cash of ₹3,977 cr, gives ₹3,141;"],[13.889,44.59,52.964,1.809,1.634,"it is punitive because capex absorbs cash. At ₹11,442 the shares sit at 60x Dec-"],[13.889,46.034,52.931,1.809,1.634,"27-basis earnings; peer CRDMO names trade at 44.0x forward earnings. The"],[13.889,47.502,52.992,1.809,1.634,"consensus target of ₹11,083 is also below price, though 18 of 28 brokers say"],[13.889,48.946,52.934,1.809,1.634,"buy. Proof we are wrong: validation converts to commercial orders and margins"],[13.889,50.39,52.936,1.809,1.634,"stay above 40%. Downside: approvals slip or working capital does not"],[13.889,51.834,6.842,1.809,1.634,"normalise."],[13.889,54.298,13.042,1.643,1.471,"Price Performance"],[14.451,62.933,2.306,1.022,0.915,"4,000"],[14.451,61.165,2.306,1.022,0.915,"6,000"],[14.451,59.398,2.306,1.022,0.915,"8,000"],[13.961,57.63,2.796,1.022,0.915,"10,000"],[13.961,55.862,2.796,1.022,0.915,"12,000"],[18.306,63.627,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Jan 26"],[22.929,63.627,2.796,1.022,0.915,"Apr 26"],[27.701,63.627,2.47,1.022,0.915,"Jul 26"],[32.473,63.627,2.96,1.022,0.915,"Oct 26"],[18.99,64.798,2.54,1.275,1.111,"Divis ("],[21.533,64.824,0.618,1.241,1.111,"₹"],[22.145,64.798,0.303,1.275,1.111,")"],[25.229,64.798,7.901,1.275,1.111,"NIFTY 50 (rebased)"],[20.291,65.958,1.972,1.387,1.209,"YTD"],[25.561,65.958,1.433,1.387,1.209,"1m"],[30.279,65.958,1.433,1.387,1.209,"3m"],[34.446,65.958,1.984,1.387,1.209,"12m"],[15.277,67.024,1.691,1.387,1.209,"Abs"],[19.372,67.024,2.811,1.387,1.209,"79.7%"],[24.09,67.024,2.811,1.387,1.209,"23.2%"],[28.808,67.024,2.811,1.387,1.209,"34.6%"],[33.527,67.024,2.811,1.387,1.209,"74.3%"],[15.492,68.089,1.476,1.387,1.209,"Rel"],[19.372,68.089,2.811,1.387,1.209,"83.5%"],[24.09,68.089,2.811,1.387,1.209,"12.6%"],[28.808,68.089,2.811,1.387,1.209,"31.5%"],[33.527,68.089,2.811,1.387,1.209,"77.1%"],[13.889,69.947,15.839,1.643,1.471,"Valuation (₹ per share)"],[13.889,71.475,11.972,1.387,1.209,"Target (average of the two)"],[33.956,71.475,2.481,1.387,1.209,"6,690"],[13.889,72.564,13.075,